7LLHIUz35qcsmYoovfqcSyuslVT8dwpsTcZtDgPM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/icCzpFMlklibOZ1Kkicib8ZiaMpkc55DBNl8kqKMXDlJElZDqRJ8zY6Jia82129wNOKk77R4PDO3ricicmgXqKPMVLnDA2myHRiaow2uTBKTos0TTACM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>全国优秀大学生暑期夏令营</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/icCzpFMlklibMR8XQicxIRiaPtXy7mOEBvukkIbWT7PtnO5g8P3H1wxUqy0ePen83wa5CiaaoJhZUia5A69ujcetlUVhsFKd9gAoZrWDNATDgwSz4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>外国语言文化学院</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/icCzpFMlklibNJwJK54LP9BcMUiaI9athIHaRbzZamhEbq0uzge71EQ5icgPU0n7NyInsNjQgPXk5GuvB3Q0mFfVcIib4kHhialPnoz6XWgf4XwXA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/icCzpFMlklibNfBQib99u9tibBJhk6xaUAnicnhv1NBJtDfkko4rUpnRIZRiaWUEIkjnX7uwg2eL6SL64WhIsSZWgqD1nyiblMPIIGiaEvOPuu6NpsA/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>外国语言文学类</span></p></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/icCzpFMlklibO1vH21kbmmMULUpvGDOibdfz8ChNJEXQ45TVmqAlP6HSic8oVlQibMpzB4uunRBAkaZK07uZNDAJlyMaliaibWzDrXRlicMEia6oNWRo/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>北京语言大学外国语言文化学院将于2026年7月18日-19日举办2026年外国语言文学类优秀大学生暑期夏令营，旨在增进全国优秀大学生对我院外语语言文学专业的了解，促进大学生之间的学术交流。</span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>学院简介</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/icCzpFMlklibMNuQAu523YEauo4BRplnzt2uAmGE77aLAiak8SYOPwrXMo0moE9enW7yK2AYXvxKKBOevgFAZRMlzZ6U8bePt2AhP8TMxbibCAQ/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>外国语言文化学院的历史可追溯至20世纪30年代延安俄文讲习班，是新中国“红色外语人才”的摇篮。学院拥有外国语言文学一级学科硕士点、博士点、博士后流动站和区域国别学一级学科硕士点、博士点，已建设成为拥有“全贯通式”人才培养体系的交叉学科创新平台。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/icCzpFMlklibOZpcib0DS3kCULmjU8sFib06KD6UMDNiankEgBZk3chMwCQmY9gXqvekJUsw4238mAibDotlKwYPEQ0oL41e7gyJsq85yibQiaBrL8I/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>我院下设欧洲系、亚洲系、中东系、北美系，涵盖13个专业，14个语种。其中有国家级一流本科专业8个（法语、阿拉伯语、日语、朝鲜语、俄语、德语、西班牙语和意大利语），北京市“双一流”学科1个（区域国别学）。</span></p></section><section><p><span>学院拥有一支有着良好学术声誉和影响力的教师队伍。学院在编教职工93人，其中高级职称39人，占比42%，拥有博士学位教师61人，占比65.6%。学院现有教育部长江学者特聘教授1人、“万人计划”领军人才1人、“万人计划”教学名师1人、“四个一批”人才1人、享受政府特殊津贴专家2人，获评北京市教学名师1人、北京市青年教学名师2人、北京市师德先进个人1人。2023年，学院院长、国家级教学名师罗林教授领衔的区域国别学协同创新团队入选第三批“全国高校黄大年式教师团队”。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动信息</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/icCzpFMlklibN1P8ePnMccibNIuWqLPHa8iceHQoyc94Nowkk0w2eVT3wUertBAxqDbkQziar20YViaSxFd7E2RrokjN2UN0HITW14SovLp5BKC94/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>夏令营举办时间为2026年7月18日-19日。本次各项活动及考核均须采用线上方式。</span></p></section></section><section><section></section><section><section><p><span>申请条件</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/icCzpFMlklibOYMtFRD0Yn3TUMycsWK5X8nng1e0dSfdSjD6GFksjguSXEywpsyGmeCqFZbff3hU26IZ7hnuicyK3eJIiaEKtlicGIHK5UQ5Cj1k/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>申请人应为全国各高校2027年优秀应届本科毕业生（包括本校优秀毕业生）。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>符合国家免试攻读硕士研究生的基本条件，预计可获得所在学校的推荐免试资格。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>遵纪守法，身心健康，品学兼优。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>申请人第1—5学期所有课程成绩合格，学业综合成绩在本专业名列前茅，具体成绩排名由我校招生单位确认，在其他方面有突出表现的学生可以适当放宽排名限制。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>05</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>每名申请人限报一个招生单位、一个专业。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请程序</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/icCzpFMlklibMKHjEyXFZIz1yib9ibCPibFUt09YiaNmrALoN6ZCBNkJHic4bkf0W7DyNYYopxHT4oRicjSTz23LLYnKWu4AjlENBnBf5hnMUIPZPOE/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>坚持把能力提升摆在重要位置，主动加强理论学习与业务钻研，不断夯实知识根基。日常积极参与实践历练，在各项事务中积累经验，逐步补齐能力短板，全方位锤炼自身综合素质。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名时间</span></strong></p><p><span>2026年7月6日 - 7月15日</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名方式</span></strong></p><p><span>电话和邮件报名（详见第八项各专业联系方式）</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请材料</span></strong></p><p><span>（1）《北京语言大学外国语言文化学院（区域国别研究院）外国语言文学类2026年全国优秀大学生暑期夏令营申请表》（附件，均以“高校-申请专业-姓名-申请层次（硕士/直博）”命名，营员填写后需由申请人本科所在院系审核盖章）；</span></p><p><span>（2）身份证（正反面扫描在同一页）；</span></p><p><span>（3）学生证（本人信息页及加盖各学期注册章页）；</span></p><p><span>（4）本科成绩单和专业排名证明（由学校或院系教务管理部门盖章）；</span></p><p><span>（5）外语水平证明；</span></p><p><span>（6）补充材料（获奖证明、论文、研究成果证明等，如无，此项可以不提交）；</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/icCzpFMlklibO8ApcPhc2hwqHI1nYM8tLzBhQeCnhiaXxBAJWWGwa4SJqDW5SuCHXu9U16015LuOPS2YXIjt0bQ1ISTfgrLsNWmicgiav9epuiaHA/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/icCzpFMlklibN6eZM2EtHhLvwib3DriatsX8EX80HRvGHvJ02c9ibkpTicyKGYmjXHCzkiaRoiaVTicbUp2cibcxtzCdWmJH7OfibVV8HUCDkqiaxgdTpf4/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>    申请人须认真准备以上材料并填写相关信息，所填内容要真实准确。将（1）至（6）项申请材料原件扫描整合为一个PDF格式的文件，文件名为“姓名+2026年全国优秀大学生暑期夏令营申请材料+所报专业（俄语/法语/德语/西语/意语/日语/韩语/阿语）”，邮件主题为“姓名+2026年全国优秀大学生夏令营申请材料+所报专业（俄语/法语/德语/西语/意语/日语/韩语/阿语）”。线上报到时需提供相应材料原件备查。</span></p><p><span>有意向报考我校“直博”项目的同学可在我校预推免报名系统开放后报名，参加直博生面试。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/icCzpFMlklibNeIrpBQxKdaaeIomQXA1iaubB2YSWSIcflYQSqY6yPj7r6a6VPNqudHSGCetLUWRazSg8DFianW0qk2ecfQIGq4N4tZhaia47UMM/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/icCzpFMlklibPu7upJA9hkZiawFt33LXhexJVH8BmkpFQz05JVfhiarQHrZdbcUqIuJNxcOaufe59OF8ia5swn4niaMhU4bY2MwhLknSVDCkbdgwc/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>    我学院将根据申请人提交的材料进行综合评审，确定夏令营入营名单，并直接通知考生本人（以电话、微信、短信或电子邮件、网络公布等方式）。入营名单以北京语言大学研究生院官网公布名单为准。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动详情</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/icCzpFMlklibNzPRJ13Z03IPthialfR6EPkibtR8zOKsmSXjwa1oNhwQTFwqqE4ODHgvZ5vh4hzAcCLA7frkj9MdPTlJujPIo88hqlXMGCGYck8/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>    夏令营活动内容一般包括学科及专业介绍、学术讲座、座谈研讨、外语水平测试、专业水平测试、综合素质考查等。</span></p><p><span>    夏令营期间所有营员必须遵守国家相应法律法规，遵守夏令营的安排，未按规定时间报到，或不按时参加活动，无故缺席者将被取消营员资格。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/icCzpFMlklibO7icO7CKibLXib9k4XibH5uKicrx0QFfjawwuPwu1ibOlm8xDzCJLj5ZVtGhLGcssicHia73v20n9nrtLHqke2nOFOnullrlJCUQegorU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>“优秀营员”评定办法</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/icCzpFMlklibPZY0RhwYeBQtF8pxrxhyHrCnFtkabo6luuibwbGHNRicAU8MIMCNiaiaHCpkib8yWWCXToeWOlgr0nVjib1D7T9vlLnNkH3e1DrMiaHc/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>学院将根据学生的申请材料、在营期间表现等综合情况对营员进行全面评定，评出“优秀营员”。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/icCzpFMlklibN5nlnYNnqUPXH14EKwGuSs8Wibjp3Sla7dgWftH0rwm5gDGCPtLJGTibnk7jO2Eo8Q7kShsRg7qjAm9GM4f25mAeTsTicCEyibnmU/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/icCzpFMlklibPUPUhxvt4U0XqsykuQol3pqicYTzLO1ugJAeOic9Q3jdQeqoAMhlWF7hk6AGf4uRvO5BJLGd1InibBLkI0cFcuQGOibibfe93eyLAE/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>参营费用</span></strong></p></section></section><section